TTYCHATTER.PYTHON(1)        User Commands        TTYCHATTER.PYTHON(1)

NAME
    ttychatter.python - terminal chat client track in the ttychatter project

SYNOPSIS
    ttychatter.python [session]
    ttychatter.python --help
    ttychatter.python --version

DESCRIPTION
    This flat-layout release keeps the Bash track available while the ncurses
    track receives the OpenRouter-first model-browser work. The Bash clients
    remain terminal-oriented, session-capable, and documented in the README.

VERSION
    ttychatter.python version 3.4
